  "description": "A standalone JSON schema validator node for FluxFlow: a value in, a validation result broadcast out, with the original input fanned to Valid/Invalid ports. No engine required.",
  "id": "FluxFlow.Components.Validation",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-06-19T12:52:32.013Z",
